sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Flask as Flask Application
    participant Guard as Auth / CSRF / RBAC
    participant DB as SQLite Database
    User->>Browser: Open page or login
    Browser->>Flask: HTTP GET / POST
    Flask->>Flask: Open DB connection
    Flask->>Guard: Load session & validate
    alt Unauthorized or invalid request
        Guard-->>Browser: Redirect / 403 / 400
    else Authorized
        Guard->>Flask: Invoke route handler
        Flask->>DB: Query / transaction
        DB-->>Flask: Rows / result
        Flask-->>Browser: Render HTML / redirect
    end
    Flask->>Flask: Close DB connection
